# DAT Permissions

## Order (critical)
1. `requestAndroidPermissions()` — Android only, gates SDK init. No-op on iOS.
2. `startRegistration()` + `handleUrl()` — one-time registration
3. `requestCameraPermission()` — shows Meta AI permission sheet

## Camera permission
```dart
final granted = await MetaWearablesDat.requestCameraPermission();
// Throws CameraPermissionException on error
// .isDeviceDisconnected, .isPermissionDenied, .isInternalError
```

Check status: `getCameraPermissionStatus()` returns `bool`.

See `example/lib/providers/device_provider.dart` for canonical pattern.
